  (text "4G Network Modem Connection Details\n\nPin 1: Gnd			Pin 5: Netlight\nPin 2: PWRKEY		Pin 6: Tx\nPin 3: Rx			Pin 7: VDDIO\nPin 4: Reset		Pin 8: VDD"
    (at 168.91 184.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4c2f1745-65ad-4105-a89c-de9ecef6f9ef)
  )
  (text "Temperature & Humidity Measurement\n\nUp to 5 DHT22 sesnors can be connected using\nstandard ethernet cables up to 10m. These\nsensors are used to measure temperature and\nhumidity in different areas."
    (at 34.29 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 72d3fee2-e7ca-4c20-8c77-e8f6268c04e8)
  )
  (text "Battery Voltage Measurement\n\nVoltage divider circuits allow voltages up to 15V to be measured using 3.3V ADCs.\nThe voltage dividers (R4/R7, R5/R8, R6/R9) must be high precision resistors.\nFET switches prevent battery leakage through the divider circuit when not measuring.\nR10 ensures a default off state when the microncontroller is powered down.\n\nNote that Battery 1 also powers the system (via a high efficiency 5V power convertor)"
    (at 309.88 63.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d5cdd956-c309-4ee2-84d9-e6f1acdaaf06)
  )
  (text "Mains Presence Measurement\n\nPower from the USB port is used to detect whether mains electricity if present.\nThis requires an external USB adapter. USB is *not* used to power to system.\n"
    (at 309.88 77.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid f0ed5d0b-1d09-40f0-b4fe-d2bfcef6191a)
  )

